Gates from docs/PROTOCOL.md (dev: ≥ 200 trades, PF ≥ 1.25, ≥ 70% years positive, Combine pass rate ≥ 50%, cost per
pass ≤ $500), plus: the neighbouring `risk` values also profitable.

