| `tp` (target) | swing | swing; 15, 30, 45, 60, 75 ticks with risk 15, strict, confirm 1 only |
| `swing_tf` | 1h | fixed |
| `entry_tf` | 15m | fixed |

Total combinations on dev: **13**. 6 (3 `risk` × 2 `outside`, `confirm` 0) declared 2026-11-15 before the first run;
